leonardo (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix botocore compatibility: HeadObject without Accept header, SigV4
    for percent-encoded keys, POST bodies without Content-Type.
  * CompleteMultipartUpload honours bucket versioning, immutability and
    retention and returns x-amz-version-id.
  * Keep delete markers in version history; store x-amz-tagging and
    Cache-Control, Content-Disposition, Content-Encoding,
    Content-Language and Expires.
  * Validate multipart upload and object IDs before they reach the
    filesystem (path injection).
  * Keep-alive fixes: drain unread request bodies, never send 100 Continue
    for a rejected PutObject or UploadPart.
  * Bump AssertJ to 3.27.7 (GHSA-rqfh-9r24-8c9r).
  * Add tools/minio-to-leonardo.py migration script.

 -- Lucas Holt <luke@foolishgames.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

